acceptance_criteria: Reproduce the rejected receipt using a redacted fixture or supported prior writer without publishing free-form values; Report the precise invalid collection or decision shape while retaining privacy-safe diagnostics; Provide an executable evidence-preserving recovery path that cannot silently certify invalid or unrelated evidence; Prove supported older valid receipts remain readable and malformed receipts still fail closed
value: Reduce recovery ambiguity and preserve trustworthy project context for agents
outcome: A reproducible SDK contract with actionable CLI recovery and regression evidence
